sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Engineer
  participant UI as React UI
  participant API as REST API
  participant SS as SimulationService
  participant CI as CommandInvoker
  participant PE as FailurePropagationEngine
  participant BUS as EventBus
  participant OBS as Observers
  participant DB as Database

  U->>UI: choose scenario, failure type, severity
  UI->>API: POST /api/simulations
  API->>SS: create(project, failures)
  loop each failure
    SS->>CI: run(InjectFailureCommand)
    CI->>DB: validate target · insert failure_event · log command
  end
  UI->>API: POST /api/simulations/{id}/start
  API->>SS: start(id)
  SS->>CI: run(StartSimulationCommand)
  CI->>DB: reject duplicate/active simulation · validate DAG
  SS->>PE: propagate(failures)
  PE->>PE: apply sources → BFS over dependents → fixed-point evaluation → chronology BFS
  PE-->>SS: PropagationResult (statuses, ticks, paths)
  SS->>DB: save simulation_results
  SS->>BUS: publish FAILURE_INJECTED + COMPONENT_STATUS_CHANGED (tick 0)
  BUS->>OBS: notify
  OBS->>DB: update component state · event log · project health
  loop while RUNNING (UI auto-advance)
    UI->>API: POST /simulations/{id}/tick
    SS->>BUS: publish DEPENDENCY_AFFECTED / FAILURE_PROPAGATED (tick n)
    BUS->>OBS: notify → DB
  end
  SS->>SS: ImpactAnalyzer + RootCauseAnalyzer (final tick)
  SS->>BUS: PROPAGATION_COMPLETED, ROOT_CAUSE_IDENTIFIED
  API-->>UI: simulation detail + notifications
  UI-->>U: animated cascade, impact score, root cause
